---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy – Fullfill">
  <section class="privacy-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><strong>fullfill — Your Privacy, Your Peace of Mind</strong><br />
      <span class="effective-date">Effective Date: 13th Feb 2026</span></p>

      <p>fullfill is here to help you grow — not to hoard data or sell your info. This page explains what we collect, why, and how we keep it safe.</p>

      <h2>1. Who This Applies To</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The fullfill app</li>
        <li>The fullfill website (fullfill.me)</li>
        <li>All features, content, and services we provide</li>
      </ul>
      <p>By using fullfill, you're agreeing to this policy.</p>

      <h2>2. What We Collect (and Why)</h2>
      <p>We only gather what we need to make your experience awesome and secure.</p>

      <h3>A. Info You Give Us</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Account details: name, username, email, encrypted password</li>
        <li>Your content: journals, reflections, notes, routines, saved activities, check-ins</li>
      </ul>
      <p><em>Why:</em> To create/manage your account and personalize your journey. We never sell or share this.</p>

      <h3>B. Info We Collect Automatically</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Device & app data: type, OS, app version, language, timezone, usage logs</li>
        <li>Analytics: privacy-friendly tools for patterns — no individual tracking</li>
      </ul>
      <p><em>Why:</em> To improve fullfill, fix bugs, and understand feature usage.</p>

      <h3>C. Payment Info</h3>
      <p>All payments go through Apple or Google. We don't store full card info — just confirmation of payment status.</p>

      <h3>D. Optional Info</h3>
      <p>Notifications, AI personalization, and other extras are optional. Turn them on or off anytime.</p>

      <h2>3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Run fullfill smoothly</li>
        <li>Personalize your experience</li>
        <li>Improve features</li>
        <li>Keep your account safe</li>
        <li>Communicate updates</li>
        <li>Provide support</li>
        <li>Do anonymized analytics</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We never sell your data or target ads.</p>

      <h2>4. How We Protect Your Data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>HTTPS encryption</li>
        <li>Secure cloud storage</li>
        <li>Strict access control</li>
        <li>Regular security checks</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Your journals and reflections stay private.</p>

      <h2>5. How Long We Keep Your Data</h2>
      <p>We keep your info only as long as you use fullfill. Delete your account, and personal data is gone. Anonymized stats may remain but can't identify you.</p>

      <h2>6. Sharing Your Data</h2>
      <p>We only share with trusted partners who help run fullfill — cloud hosts, analytics, AI services. They follow strict privacy rules. We never sell or share your data for ads.</p>

      <h2>7. AI Features</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>AI uses data securely to personalize your experience</li>
        <li>Your entries are not used to train public AI models</li>
        <li>Outputs stored only as long as needed</li>
        <li>You can opt out anytime</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Access your data</li>
        <li>Correct mistakes</li>
        <li>Delete or export your data</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent for optional features</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@fullfill.me">hello@fullfill.me</a> to exercise these rights.</p>

      <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have questions or privacy concerns, reach out at <a href="mailto:hello@fullfill.me">hello@fullfill.me</a>. We read every message.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy-section {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 60px 20px;
  }

  .container {
    width: 100%;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-top: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 1.1em;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .effective-date {
    color: var(--text-secondary, #666);
  }

  ul {
    margin-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  em {
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .privacy-section {
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  }
</style>